# Trying to access array offset on value of type null Product.php

In the Product.php file an error occurs on the following lines:
        array_unshift($result, null);
        foreach ($result as &$value) {
            $value = $value['id_product'];
        }

This code adds null to the beginning of $result and in the first interaction it gives an error when querying the id_product variable because the first value of $result is null

This causes a php error:
Got error 'PHP message: [PHP Warning #2] Trying to access array offset on value of type null .../Product.php..., line 7245

## Attendu
We hope it doesn't cause that any error or warning

## Étapes
Execute this php snippet:

// Enter your code here, enjoy!
        $result=array(array('id_product'=>10));
        array_unshift($result, null);
        foreach ($result as &$value) {
            $value = $value['id_product'];
	    print($value);
        }

You will get this: 
Warning: Trying to access array offset on value of type null in ...

Solution proposal:
       // Move array_unshift to the end
        foreach ($result as &$value) {
            $value = $value['id_product'];
	    print($value);
        }
       **array_unshift($result, null);**

